BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (  Both villages now had more than they started with.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
