BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (        .) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      The villages prospered, for they understood the sacred truth: **the gods multiply what is ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (        given in trust, but only reciprocity makes both sides flourish.**) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (      When selfishness entered one village's heart, taking all without returning, the wells ran ) Tj ET
