BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (      # The Myth of the Golden Spring) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (      In ancient times, there lived two wanderers who discovered a magical spring. The first wan) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (        derer, the Giver, possessed silver coins. The second, the Keeper, guarded the spring's b) Tj ET
