BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 748.0 Td (    # The Myth of the Twin Wells) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (    In ancient times, two villages were separated by a barren valley. Each village had a sacred ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (      well that held the tears of the first gods.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (    The Oracle revealed a secret: "When water from one well is poured into the valley between yo) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (      u, the gods will multiply it threefold before it reaches the other village. But only the r) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (      eceiving village can decide how much to return.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (    The first village, though fearful, poured one jar into the valley. True to the prophecy, thr) Tj ET
