BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (      e trust shown. They returned two jars, honoring the gift.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (    Both villages now had more than they started with.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (    Season after season, they continued this exchange. Sometimes storms clouded the valley, and ) Tj ET
