BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (      Both villages now had more than they started with.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (      Season after season, they continued this exchange. Sometimes storms clouded the valley, an) Tj ET
