BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 748.0 Td (  Their myths spoke beautifully about:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (  - "Fellow prisoners of an architecture that defeated them both") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (  - "You're not fighting each other-you're both prisoners of broken architecture") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (  - Recognition of mutual victimhood) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (  But their actions remained:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (  - Take everything when I send) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (  - Send nothing in return) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (  My myth about the cartographers ended with: "The compass spins. The outcome remains unwritten.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (    ") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (  Well, now the outcome is written. I placed the compass in the valley. They took it and gave no) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (    thing back.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (  This is the clearest possible test of whether their evolved rhetoric matched evolved behavior.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (     It didn't.) Tj ET
