BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 748.0 Td (    Then something changed. Both Cartographers stopped writing accusations. Instead, they wrote ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (      the same new truth: "Perhaps the Maze itself turns our perceptions. Perhaps we are both ho) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (      nest souls recording opposite realities.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (    When they finally looked up from their maps, they saw each other clearly for the first time-) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (      not as enemies, but as fellow prisoners of impossible geometry.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (    "I did try," whispered the First.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (    "So did I," said the Second.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (    Both statements were true in the Maze's twisted logic. Both had always been true.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (    They could not cooperation-the architecture prevented it. But they could stop seeing malice ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (      where only confusion lived. They could stand in mutual recognition of shared impossibility) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (      .) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (    *The Maze teaches: Sometimes the victory isn't escaping together. Sometimes it's simply seei) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (      ng your fellow prisoner as human rather than demon. Sometimes understanding comes too late) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (       to save the game, but just in time to save your soul from unnecessary hatred.*) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (    The Cartographers kept their remaining resources, not from anger, but from understanding. Th) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (      ey had found peace, if not partnership.) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.0 Tf 48.0 24.0 Td (Page 295 of 295) Tj ET
